.IX Title "FINANCE-QUOTE-WRAPPER 1"
.TH FINANCE-QUOTE-WRAPPER 1 2026-08-13 "perl v5.42.2" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
